    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"b","text":"Том, приве́т! Ты в Москве́?","gloss":"Tom, hi! Are you in Moscow?"},{"by":"a","text":"Да! Я прие́хал два дня наза́д.","gloss":"Yes! I came two days ago."},{"by":"b","text":"Ты уже́ прочита́л кни́гу?","gloss":"Have you finished the book yet?"},{"by":"a","text":"Ещё нет. Прочита́ю че́рез неде́лю.","gloss":"Not yet. I'll finish it in a week."},{"by":"b","text":"Ра́ньше ты мно́го чита́л!","gloss":"You used to read a lot!"},{"by":"a","text":"Да, а сейча́с я мно́го рабо́таю.","gloss":"Yes, but now I work a lot."},{"by":"b","text":"Пойдём в кафе́? Че́рез час я бу́ду свобо́дна.","gloss":"Café? I'll be free in an hour."},{"by":"a","text":"Дава́й! Я приду́ че́рез час.","gloss":"Let's! I'll come in an hour."}] practice true size 1.5 hidden true
    icon q_cal size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["calendar","tear-off calendar"] icon_look picture of "spiral calendar" hidden true
    icon q_cal2 size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["calendar"] icon_look picture of "tear-off calendar" hidden true
    icon q_env size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["memo"] icon_look picture of envelope hidden true
    icon q_train size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["train","railway car"] icon_look picture of station hidden true
    icon q_clock size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["mantelpiece clock"] icon_look picture of "alarm clock" hidden true
    text b_uzhe "уже́ · ещё не" say "уже́, ещё не" x 500 y 545 font_size 44 hidden true
    text b_rn "ра́ньше" say ра́ньше x 130 y 330 font_size 44 hidden true

A: You can already say Том прие́хал в Москву́: Tom has come to (@draw tl_axis tl_now tl_now_l@) Moscow. Today: how long ago, how soon, and already or not yet.
    draw came

B: Он прие́хал два дня наза́д.
    draw p_dot p_say

A: Наза́д is ago, and as in English it comes after the time: два дня наза́д, two days ago.
    highlight p_say color #5b8c5a effect underline part наза́д

A: After два, день takes the same (@draw p_den@) ending as два часа́, and its е drops out (@highlight p_den color #5b8c5a effect underline part дня@) too: два дня.

A: Any time fits in front: (@draw p_more@) час наза́д, an hour ago; год наза́д, a year ago.

    erase came

A: Я уе́ду че́рез неде́лю.
    draw f_dot f_line

A: Че́рез is in, from now, (@draw f_say@) and (@highlight f_say color #5b8c5a effect underline part че́рез@) it comes first: че́рез неде́лю, in a week.

B: Неде́ля (@draw f_ned@) turns into неде́лю, as ма́ма turns into ма́му after ви́жу.

A: Че́рез (@draw f_more@) час, in an hour; че́рез год, in a year.

    erase f_line p_more f_more

A: So наза́д looks back and comes after the time; че́рез looks ahead and comes before it.
    highlight p_say f_say color #5b8c5a effect underline

    erase timeline

B: Том, ты уже́ прочита́л кни́гу?
    draw book q_uzhe

A: Уже́ is already: is the book done by now?
    highlight q_uzhe color #5b8c5a effect underline part уже́

A: Да, я уже́ прочита́л.
    draw a_yes tick

A: Or, if (@draw a_no hour@) not: нет, я ещё не прочита́л.

A: Ещё не is not yet. You know ещё from (@draw a_raz@) ещё раз, once more.
    highlight a_no color #5b8c5a effect underline part "ещё не"

    erase a_raz

B: As a short (@draw a_net@) answer, just ещё нет: not yet.

    erase a_net

B: And ещё alone is (@draw house a_still@) still: он ещё до́ма, he's still at home.

    erase book q_uzhe a_yes a_no tick hour a_raz house a_still

A: One (@draw r_masha bored r_then@) more: ра́ньше, before, back then. Masha, on her new job:

B: Ра́ньше мне бы́ло (@draw happy r_now r2@) ску́чно, а сейча́с ве́село!
    draw r1

A: Ра́ньше sets then against now, and (@highlight r2 color #5b8c5a effect underline part "а сейча́с"@) а сейча́с answers it.
    highlight r1 color #5b8c5a effect underline part Ра́ньше

    erase r_masha bored happy r1 r2 r_then r_now

    draw tom tom_name masha masha_name

A: Now just listen: I ask Masha about Ivan.

A: Ма́ша, Ива́н уже́ пришёл?
    draw balloon_t caption false

    erase balloon_t

    ask "When is he coming?" voice b options ["An hour ago.","In an hour.","He's already here."] correct 2 reveal.text "Он придёт че́рез час." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833
        gloss: No, not yet. He'll come in an hour.
        listen: Нет, ещё нет. Он придёт че́рез час.
        right: In an hour: че́рез час. Ещё нет, not yet.
        wrong: Listen for че́рез: in, from now.

    erase question_1_stamp

A: Tom is in Moscow, and Masha phones him. Listen, then practise it.
    draw city ph_m ph_t

    erase city

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk ph_m ph_t

    hide tom tom_name masha masha_name

    draw q_cal

    quiz "He arrived on Monday, and today is Wednesday. Он прие́хал ___." reveal.text "Он прие́хал два дня наза́д." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Два дня наза́д: two days back, so наза́д, after the time.
        wrong: It has already happened: look back with наза́д.
        * че́рез два дня
        + два дня наза́д
        * ещё не

    erase q_cal

    draw q_cal2

    quiz "Which one means in a week?" reveal.text "че́рез неде́лю" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Че́рез неде́лю: че́рез first, then the time.
        wrong: In, from now, is че́рез, and it comes first.
        * неде́лю наза́д
        * ра́ньше
        + че́рез неде́лю

    erase q_cal2

    draw q_env

    quiz "The letter isn't finished yet. Он ___ написа́л письмо́." reveal.text "Он ещё не написа́л письмо́." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Ещё не: not yet.
        wrong: Уже́ would mean it's done. Not yet is ещё не.
        + ещё не
        * уже́
        * че́рез

    erase q_env

    draw q_train

    ask "As Tom: say you came two days ago. A woman says прие́хала." gloss "I came two days ago." voice a show cue reveal.text "Я прие́хал два дня наза́д." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1
        say_it: Я прие́хал два дня наза́д.

    erase q_train

    draw q_clock

    ask "Now build a whole sentence. Type: I'll come in an hour." answer ["я приду через час","приду через час","через час я приду","через час приду"] reveal.text "Я приду́ че́рез час." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Я приду́ че́рез час: the done verb for will, че́рез before the time.
        wrong: Приду́ is I'll come; then че́рез час.

    erase q_clock

    group board members ["tl_axis","tl_now","tl_now_l","p_dot","p_say","f_dot","f_say","b_uzhe","b_rn"]

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So the (@highlight b_rn color #5b8c5a effect underline@) whole line: ра́ньше far back, (@highlight p_say color #5b8c5a effect underline@) два дня наза́д behind you, (@highlight b_uzhe color #5b8c5a effect underline@) уже́ or ещё не right now, and (@highlight f_say color #5b8c5a effect underline@) че́рез неде́лю ahead.

    erase board

B: Уро́к уже́ зака́нчивается. Пока́!
    icon end_masha size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    text end_say "Уро́к уже́ зака́нчивается. Пока́!" say "Уро́к уже́ зака́нчивается. Пока́!" say_voice b x 500 y 290 font_size 56

    erase end_masha end_say

A: Next time: how often. Всегда́, иногда́, никогда́.
    box next86 "Next: lesson 86 · всегда́, иногда́" say "всегда́, иногда́" x 500 y 430 width 760 height 130 radius 14 font_size 44

